   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to publishing of Palestine-Israel Journal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

St&#xf6;det avser att delfinansiera utgivningen av ett nummer av tidskriften Palestine- Israel Journal. Insatsens aktiviteter avslutades under 2015. Detta till&#xe4;ggsbeslut omfattar den &#xe5;terst&#xe5;ende utbetalningen inom ramen f&#xf6;r avtalet och som inte betalades under 2015 men kommer att betalas 2016. All tidigare bed&#xf6;mning &#xe4;r fortsatt giltig.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to publishing an edition of Palestine Israel Journal. The contribution activities were completed in 2015. This is an additional decision relating to remaining funds within the agreement that were not paid in 2015 and will be paid in 2016. All previous assessments remain valid.</narrative>
  </description>
